pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Output-frame paced, synchronized on game state. From seed
# appdata-2026-09-27 (167,700 Cr): as fh1-race-sync up to car select, then
# pick "Buy new car" (left, A), wait for the autoshow, take the recommended
# Jaguar XKR-S (A: showroom and its autosave), buy it with credits (A, A) and
# wait for the car's thumbnail, which the game renders in a studio, resolves
# and saves as Thumbnail_7.xdc in the private copy of the profile. The file
# holds the car only when resolves reach guest memory.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
